# Google Drive sync. Optional: without it the app builds and runs exactly as
# before, and the Drive card on /backup stays a description with nothing to
# click.
#
# This is an OAuth *client id*, which is public by design — it ships in the
# bundle and is visible to anyone. There is no client secret in this flow, and
# one must never be added here. See docs/google-drive-sync.md for how to make
# one and which origins to authorize.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (git-ignored) to use it in dev.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
